						</div>
						<div class="market-item">
							<Icon name="map-pin" size={30} />
							<strong>Community Centers</strong>
							<p>Parks, recreation centers, and municipal facilities</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="why-choose">
				<div class="container">
					<div class="why-choose-grid">
						<div class="why-choose-intro">
							<p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Why Texas Turf Maintenance</p>
							<h2>Built on Sports-Field Standards, Applied Everywhere Else</h2>
							<p>Athletic fields don't tolerate shortcuts — GMAX compliance and player safety leave no room for it. We hold every property we touch, commercial or competitive, to that same standard.</p>
						</div>
						<ul class="why-choose-list">
							<li><Icon name="check-square" size={22} /> Proven expertise across restaurants, dog daycares, and commercial properties</li>
							<li><Icon name="check-square" size={22} /> Deep understanding of Texas climate and diverse regional turf conditions</li>
							<li><Icon name="check-square" size={22} /> Industrial-grade cleaning and maintenance equipment for thorough results</li>
							<li><Icon name="check-square" size={22} /> Commitment to excellence and customer satisfaction on every project</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="lead-magnets">
				<div class="container">
					<p class="eyebrow">Free Resources</p>
					<h2>For Athletic Directors</h2>
					<p class="section-intro">Get expert insights and tools to make informed turf maintenance decisions</p>
					<div class="magnets-grid">
						<div class="magnet-item">
							<div class="magnet-icon"><Icon name="book-open" /></div>
							<h3>Athletic Director's Guide to Turf Maintenance</h3>
							<p>Complete 15-page guide covering maintenance schedules, budget planning, and compliance requirements</p>
							<a href="/contact?resource=athletic-guide" class="magnet-link">Download Free Guide →</a>
						</div>
						<div class="magnet-item">
							<div class="magnet-icon"><Icon name="calculator" /></div>
							<h3>ROI Calculator</h3>
							<p>Calculate the exact cost savings of professional maintenance vs. full field replacement</p>
							<a href="/contact?resource=roi-calculator" class="magnet-link">Get Calculator →</a>
						</div>
						<div class="magnet-item">
							<div class="magnet-icon"><Icon name="check-square" /></div>
							<h3>GMAX Compliance Checklist</h3>
							<p>Essential safety testing checklist to ensure your field meets all athletic program requirements</p>
							<a href="/contact?resource=gmax-checklist" class="magnet-link">Download Checklist →</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="cta">
				<div class="container">
					<h2>Ready to Restore Your Turf?</h2>
					<p>Contact us today for a free consultation and quote for your artificial turf maintenance needs.</p>
					<a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Get Started Today</a>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>

