			<div class="container">
				<div class="footer-content">
					<div class="footer-section">
						<h3>Texas Turf Maintenance</h3>
							<p class="footer-tagline">Clean. Safe. Game Ready.</p>
						<p>Professional artificial turf maintenance services across Texas - serving Dallas, Houston, Austin, San Antonio and all major Texas markets.</p>
